Well done, August. 《Teeth gnashing》

@Anonymous
This is the closest I've ever come to falling into both groups. It was a rare time I felt frustrated longer than I felt challenged. But I think these experiences make for camaraderie, so for me it's all good.

Besides, I much, much prefer a puzzle like today's than one that is over too quickly and easily to put up a fight. The constructors and editors are dedicated human beings, and if they are going to attempt to challenge us, there are going to be moments that frustrate us, perhaps more than they intend. I much prefer that to them playing it safe.

